:: Tp pad 2 purchase {"position":"2100,2150","size":"100,100"}
You get closer to the Teleportation pad to see a screen popup infront of you...

"You need to buy access to the Teleportation pad to use it."

<div class="UIButtons">
<<button "Buy access to the teleportation pad. | 1500 col">>
<<if $Coins >= 1500>>
<<set $Coins -= 1500>>
<<set $tppadTWO to true>>
<<goto "Oakheart centre">>
<<elseif $tppadTWO == true>>
<<script>>
UI.alert("You already bought the house!");
<</script>>
<<elseif $Coins <= 1499>>
<<script>>
UI.alert("You dont have enough col!");
<</script>>
<</if>>
<</button>>
</div>

[[Go back|Oakheart centre]]


